203 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 101 0 R
/E (The Pythagoreans were the first to remove the Earth from the center of the universe. They did not do so for religious or metaphysical reasons, but for astronomical ones. This intellectual achievement, which anticipates by nearly two thousand years the Renaissance theories of Copernicus and Kepler, begins here. And the creator of this celestial system is Philolaus.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
204 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
