221 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 103 0 R
/E (A geographical consequence is also that lands beyond the Pillars of Hercules lie in eternal shadow, since the Counter-Earth hides the central fire from that region. Herodotus in fact reports the existence of peoples in the north who sleep for six months a year, as they dwell in perpetual night for half the year.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [2]
>>
